	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_076b8:
	ZH 1:
	'The lord of Osaka Castle was'
	R
	'in the castle tower.'
	R
	'He was in a rare bad mood.'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	!VAR0516 : 417!
	\L_076d4:
	\L_07680:
	ZH 1:
	'And what of the Tenshiists?'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	!VAR0516 : 418!
	\L_07744:
	\L_076f0:
	ZH 1:
	'I found a group that continues'
	R
	'to defy us, so I ordered my'
	R
	'subordinates to kill them all.'
	\L_077a5:
	ZH 1:
	'Many of them were afraid they'
	R
	'would go to Hell if they'
	R
	'killed a Tenshi priest...'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_07680:
	ZH 1:
	'Kill them.'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_076f0:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, many of my soldiers do'
	R
	'not follow Tenshiism’s'
	R
	'teachings and cut the monks to'
	R
	'pieces...'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_07680:
	ZH 1:
	'No, I’m saying to kill those'
	R
	'cowards that feared they would'
	R
	'go to Hell.'
	\L_077a5:
	ZH 1:
	'You won’t go to Hell no matter'
	R
	'how many of those priests you'
	R
	'kill.'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_076f0:
	ZH 1:
	'B-But that’s far too brutal a'
	R
	'punishment!'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_07680:
	ZH 1:
	'Tell the entire army this.'
	R
	'I, Nobunaga, will teach anyone'
	R
	'who follows that foolish'
	R
	'religion the meaning of Hell.'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_076f0:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes. Then the aforementioned'
	R
	'soldiers should be...'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_07680:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Toukichirou）'
	R
	'Ook.'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_07680:
	ZH 1:
	'Toukichirou says, \"Kill them.\"'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_07752:
	\L_076b8:
	ZH 1:
	'The general bowed without'
	R
	'saying anything and left the'
	R
	'room.'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_0769c:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmph... Damned Tenshiists...'
	\L_077a5:
	ZH 1:
	'Right when the war with Leazas'
	R
	'started, they took the'
	R
	'opportunity to preach...'
	\L_077a5:
	ZH 1:
	'Not only that...'
	R
	'They’re hiding something.'
	R
	'If they weren’t, they couldn’t'
	R
	'oppose me to this extent.'
	\L_077a5:
	ZH 1:
	'Might they know about my body?'
	\L_077a5:
	ZH 1:
	'It is possible...'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_076b8:
	ZH 1:
	'Nobunaga looked down and'
	R
	'thought to himself.'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_07680:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Toukichirou）'
	R
	'Oook...'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_076b8:
	ZH 1:
	'The monkey on Nobunaga’s'
	R
	'shoulder peeked anxiously at'
	R
	'his face.'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_07680:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t worry, Toukichirou.'
	R
	'If we kill them all, there'
	R
	'won’t be any more problems.'
	\L_077a5:
	ZH 1:
	'When I fully restore my body,'
	R
	'I need not fuss over a country'
	R
	'so small as JAPAN any longer...'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_076b8:
	ZH 1:
	'Nobunaga looked out a window'
	R
	'to the continent to the west.'
	R
	'The sky was red in the setting'
	R
	'sun.'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_07680:
	ZH 1:
	'Wait for me, continent.'
	\L_077a5:
	\L_07798:
	\L_076b8:
	ZH 1:
	'Nobunaga’s eyes glowed red.'
	R
	'It was such a vivid red that'
	R
	'it clearly wasn’t just because'
	R
	'of the sunset.'
	\L_077a5:
